{
  "$comment": "门禁清单：本文件是唯一来源，14 道仓库级门禁各一条，不重复登记。加一道门禁只改这里 —— 本地门禁（scripts/check.sh）、持续集成（.github/workflows/ci.yml）、门禁自检（scripts/verify-gates.sh）都经 scripts/gates/run.mjs 读它。每条都必须带 canaries（门禁自检的演练节号，1..14）与执行方式：steps = 这条命令本身可由 runner 直接执行；section = 真门禁由本地 / CI 的某个步骤实现，只能靠门禁自检第 N 节证明它会红，runner 不代跑（用 executedBy 写清是谁在跑）。演练节号不必一门一号：skills-format（#309）与 archcheck 共用第 3 节，因为它的人造违规用例写在脚本自己的 --self-test 里，与第 3 节「规则自检」是同一种证明形状。",
  "notGates": [14],
  "notGatesReason": "演练第 14 节（生成式装饰参数校验，#286）不是仓库级门禁：#287 AC4 明写清单只收「清单 / 版本 / 判定 / 重复安装」四件，不含参数脚本。它由 scripts/check.sh 的 gates 段、.github/workflows/ci.yml 的 frontend-lint job 直接执行，verify-gates.sh 第 14 节证明它会红。必须在这里显式登记：--check-coverage 只豁免登记过的节号，未登记的演练仍然算「没人负责」。",
  "gates": [
    {
      "id": "backend-test",
      "label": "后端单测（race + integration，含 golden 与容器契约）",
      "group": "backend",
      "canaries": [1],
      "section": 1,
      "executedBy": "scripts/check.sh backend（go test -race -tags integration）与 ci.yml 的 backend-integration job —— 需要 Docker / MySQL 编排，不适合由 runner 直接起"
    },
    {
      "id": "archcheck",
      "label": "archcheck 规则自检 + 棘轮（两遍）",
      "group": "backend",
      "canaries": [2, 3],
      "steps": [
        { "cwd": "backend", "command": ["go", "test", "./tools/archcheck/..."] },
        {
          "cwd": "backend",
          "command": [
            "go",
            "run",
            "./tools/archcheck",
            "--mode=error",
            "--max-violations=__ARCH_MAX_VIOLATIONS__",
            "."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cwd": "backend",
          "command": [
            "go",
            "run",
            "./tools/archcheck",
            "--mode=error",
            "--skip-tests=false",
            "--max-violations=__ARCH_MAX_VIOLATIONS__",
            "."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "skills-format",
      "label": "运行时策略 skill 格式校验（frontmatter + 负向用例）",
      "group": "backend",
      "canaries": [3],
      "steps": [
        { "cwd": ".", "command": ["node", "scripts/check-skills.mjs", "--self-test"] },
        { "cwd": ".", "command": ["node", "scripts/check-skills.mjs"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "frontend-typecheck",
      "label": "前端 typecheck（两端，先 nuxt prepare）",
      "group": "frontend",
